{
  "info": {
    "name": "Pitang Reimbursement Control",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "## Setup\n\n```bash\nbun install\nbun run --cwd packages/backend prisma:migrate\nbun run --cwd packages/backend prisma:seed\nbun run --cwd packages/backend dev\n```\n\n## Seed Users\n\n| Role | Email | Password |\n|------|-------|----------|\n| ADMIN | admin@example.com | admin123 |\n| EMPLOYEE | employee@test.com | secret123 |\n| MANAGER | manager@test.com | secret123 |\n| FINANCE | finance@test.com | secret123 |\n\n## Variables\n\n| Variable | Source |\n|----------|--------|\n| `url` | http://localhost:3000 |\n| `adminToken` | Login (Admin) auto-save |\n| `employeeToken` | Login (Employee) auto-save |\n| `managerToken` | Login (Manager) auto-save |\n| `financeToken` | Login (Finance) auto-save |\n| `categoryId` | Copy from Create Category response |\n| `reimbursementId` | Copy from Create Reimbursement response |\n\n## Recommended Execution Order\n\n1. Auth → Login for all 4 roles\n2. Categories → Create Category (saves `categoryId`)\n3. Reimbursements — Full Cycle (saves `reimbursementId`, runs full flow)\n4. Explore remaining folders"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "description": "Authenticate each role. Tokens auto-saved to collection variables.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (Admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const r = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (r.token) pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', r.token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"email\":\"admin@example.com\",\"password\":\"admin123\"}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{url}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            }
          }
